 boy's desires and accept each other's desires. Under the sky after the rain, the men and women's feelings were different, but their satisfaction levels overlapped, and there were two people who were lost in thought.\n\nEpisode 2\n\nAme no Yo ni\n\nOn a rainy night when a middle aged man was desperate, a woman at a girls' bar named Aine approached him and he entered the bar, and then he started going to the bar several times. About a month later, he met a drunken Aine at a standing bar in the daytime. When he asked her about it, she told him that she was unemployed. After listening to her complaints for a long time and caring for her, they were alone together in a park restroom.\n\nNatsu\n\nThe school pool was covered with the summer sun. As a boy is cleaning it, a female student, the class president, comes to help him. When they are almost finished, the girl slips and gets drenched in the pool water. He took her hand and helped her up. She says she has something she wants to try... and the two spend a summer of youth.\n\n(Source: Mediabank, translated)"},"tags":[{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Feet","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Armpits","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Sweat","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Ito wo Yoru","english":null,"native":"糸を撚る","romaji":"Ito wo Yoru","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"捻丝"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"捻线"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"adult"}